# Revision-audit records (paper_*/audit/): local revision bookkeeping only.
# Nothing under them is read by the LaTeX build (main.tex / supplement.tex
# input only sections/, figures/, tables/, references.bib) or by the experiment
# pipelines. The few redraw/verification helpers that do read small audit JSONs
# also need the local-only results/ caches, so they are not reproducible from a
# fresh clone either. ~700 MB of page previews and snapshots stay out of git.
paper_interface_focus/audit/
paper_zh_direct/audit/

